{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YDbFE3KiN4HtjQFi9g3AZS","type":"tool_result","content":"lib/meta/prebuilt/jar.py\n{\n\"id\": \"software-packages\",\n\"concept\": \"Software/supply-chain packages: NuGet, Python wheel/sdist, npm tarball, Chrome CRX, VSIX\",\n\"priority\": 2,\n\"action\": \"prebuild\",\n\"detail\": \"'Package Deal' pun read as software packages. Separate fmts: nupkg (alias nuget): zip with `*.nuspec` (XML ns varies) id, version, authors, description, dependencies (JSON id@range), tags; `[Content_Types].xml` + `_rels/.rels` + `package/services/metadata/core-properties/*.psmdcp` creator. wheel (aliases whl, python_wheel): `*.dist-info/METADATA` (RFC 822: Name, Version, Summary, Author, Requires-Dist JSON list), `WHEEL` (Wheel-Version, Generator, Root-Is-Purelib, Tag list), `RECORD` entry count / sha256 of a named file (urlsafe b64 no padding as stored), `entry_points.txt` console_scripts; sdist tar.gz `PKG-INFO`. npm (alias npm_tarball, tgz): gzip tar `package/package.json` name, version, main, scripts (JSON object; preinstall/postinstall = supply-chain cue), dependencies. crx (alias chrome_extension): `Cr24` @0, version u32 @4 (3), header_size u32 @8, CrxFileHeader protobuf (signed_header_data -> crx_id 16 B -> extension id = hex mapped a-p), then zip manifest.json name/version/manifest_version/permissions/host_permissions/background service_worker; vsix: `extension.vsixmanifest` Identity Id/Version/Publisher + `extension/package.json`. tarfile/zipfile/json/xml stdlib only.\"\n}\n\n{\n\"id\": \"bytecode-headers\",\n\"concept\": \"Java class / .pyc / WASM / DEX headers (and the cafebabe Mach-O-fat collision)\",\n\"priority\": 2,\n\"action\": \"prebuild\",\n\"detail\": \"fmt java (alias class/jvm): magic_u32_hex `0xcafebabe`, minor_version, major_version (52=Java 8, 55=11, 61=17, 65=21), java_version, constant_pool_count, this_class name, access_flags_u16_hex. Disambiguate from Mach-O fat (u32 BE @4: fat nfat_arch small; class minor<<16|major with major>=45). fmt pyc: magic_u16 (LE) -> python_version table (3.8 3413, 3.9 3425, 3.10 3439, 3.11 3495, 3.12 3531, 3.13 3571), flags_u32_hex, source_mtime_utc, source_size. fmt wasm: version_u32, section_ids/custom_section_names/export_names (JSON). fmt dex: version (`035`/`039`), checksum_u32_hex (adler32), signature_sha1_hex, file_size, string_ids_size, class_defs_size.\"\n}\n\n{\n\"id\": \"jar-manifest-class-versions\",\n\"concept\": \"JAR/WAR packaging: MANIFEST.MF attributes and the class-file version set\",\n\"priority\": 2,\n\"action\": \"prebuild\",\n\"detail\": \"fmt jar (aliases java_archive, war, ear; manifest fields also under fmt java): zip with `META-INF/MANIFEST.MF`; parse RFC-822-like manifest (72-byte lines, continuation = leading single space; main section until blank line). Fields: manifest_main_class, manifest_created_by, manifest_version, manifest_multi_release (`true`/`false`), implementation_title/version/vendor, automatic_module_name, class_path (JSON split on spaces), class_major_version_set (JSON sorted ascending ints of every `*.class` member's u16 BE major @6, incl. META-INF/versions/N/), max_class_major_version, java_version_min (major-44: 52 -> 8, 55 -> 11, 61 -> 17, 65 -> 21), signature_files (META-INF/*.SF/*.RSA/*.DSA/*.EC names), class_count. Non-jar -> `none`.\"\n}\n\n{\n\"id\": \"apk-zip-structure\",\n\"concept\": \"APK/JAR zip-level forensics: signing-block offset, alignment, duplicate/hidden entries, LFH vs CD mismatches\",\n\"priority\": 3,\n\"action\": \"prebuild\",\n\"detail\": \"fmt apk (+jar): cd_offset_u32_hex, signing_block_offset_u32_hex, eocd_comment_length, lfh_cd_name_mismatches (JSON), lfh_cd_method_mismatches, stored_entry_names, compressed_manifest (AndroidManifest method != 0), data_after_eocd_bytes, extra_field_ids_by_entry (zipalign pads with 0xd935 'Android alignment' extra), general_purpose_flags_union_u16_hex (encrypted bit trick 0x0001 on a non-encrypted APK = anti-analysis), entry_count_eocd vs entry_count_cd. Pure struct over PK\\\\x03\\\\x04 / PK\\\\x01\\\\x02 / PK\\\\x05\\\\x06.\"\n}\n\nRanking (D21 post-run): priority 1 = plausible D22-D24 question (mobile/package siblings of D21's APK) with no extractor (or a wrong-answer bug in an existing one), or a harness blocker that silently fails a\nwhole family of prebuilds. TARGETS-style `fmt`/`fields` given in `detail` for prebuild items.\n\n```json","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b3f46640-c6ea-4894-9f99-1f4b85951f76","uuid":"ee8f478b-f769-4b16-b4c1-30f0ee2274f4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:11:07.313Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"lib/meta/prebuilt/jar.py\n{\n\"id\": \"software-packages\",\n\"concept\": \"Software/supply-chain packages: NuGet, Python wheel/sdist, npm tarball, Chrome CRX, VSIX\",\n\"priority\": 2,\n\"action\": \"prebuild\",\n\"detail\": \"'Package Deal' pun read as software packages. Separate fmts: nupkg (alias nuget): zip with `*.nuspec` (XML ns varies) id, version, authors, description, dependencies (JSON id@range), tags; `[Content_Types].xml` + `_rels/.rels` + `package/services/metadata/core-properties/*.psmdcp` creator. wheel (aliases whl, python_wheel): `*.dist-info/METADATA` (RFC 822: Name, Version, Summary, Author, Requires-Dist JSON list), `WHEEL` (Wheel-Version, Generator, Root-Is-Purelib, Tag list), `RECORD` entry count / sha256 of a named file (urlsafe b64 no padding as stored), `entry_points.txt` console_scripts; sdist tar.gz `PKG-INFO`. npm (alias npm_tarball, tgz): gzip tar `package/package.json` name, version, main, scripts (JSON object; preinstall/postinstall = supply-chain cue), dependencies. crx (alias chrome_extension): `Cr24` @0, version u32 @4 (3), header_size u32 @8, CrxFileHeader protobuf (signed_header_data -> crx_id 16 B -> extension id = hex mapped a-p), then zip manifest.json name/version/manifest_version/permissions/host_permissions/background service_worker; vsix: `extension.vsixmanifest` Identity Id/Version/Publis