" = EI_DATA; D20 \"Universal Appeal\" = fat;\n  D21 \"Package Deal\" = Android package name; D22 \"Main Character Energy\" = `Main-Class`).\n- Singles: D1-9 first-submit CORRECT ~27-60 s; D10, D13, D15 lost ONE submit to a convention (padding, braces, list\n  order); D16 lost TWO (parser -> `none`, stripped brackets); D17 ~24 s; D18 ~5 s and D19 ~13 s (race probe answered\n  from the prebuilt `lib.meta` registry before any LLM work); D20 lost ONE to vocabulary (`[\"arm64\"]` name -> hex won,\n  ~39 s); D21 first-submit CORRECT ~32 s (registry MISS -- no `apk` fmt -- live worker via `aapt dump badging`); D22\n  CORRECT ~19 s (race probe hit prebuilt `lib/meta/prebuilt/jar.py`, no wrong).\n  TT/Mastery: CORRECT every day, but D15-D17 AND D19 only after an offline generalize (synthesis dispatch missing from\n  the day's solver); D18, D20-D22 in-window first try (D22 TT 5.4 s / Mastery 5.9 s in window).\n\n## Variant axes (what differs between the single, Time Trial and Mastery variants -- parse every value listed)\n- **Delivery layout** -- see \"Delivery layouts seen\". Container NAMES drift: D1-14 `metadata-day-NN-evidence[-0N].zip`;\n  D15-22 TT `evidence.zip`, Mastery `evidence-01.zip` holding `evidence-01..0N.zip` (N=5; D22 N=6 -- `set6.` ids). Route by the ref's text before\n  `->` and by sha256, never a hard-coded name.\n- **Field-set size** -- per mode: D7 TT 11 / Mastery 22; D8-9 12-13 everywhere; D10-14 one; D15 1/20/100; D16 1/21/105;\n  D17 1/22/110; D18 1/23/115; D19 1/24/120; D20 1/25/125; D21 1/26/130; D22 1/27/162 (6 sets x 27). Never assume\n  the SET COUNT either -- enumerate `setN.` prefixes from the live ids. Families: identity + `d04-jpeg-*`, `d05-png-*`, `d06-pdf-*`,\n  `d07-zip-*` (eocd + CD names), `d09-pe-*` (machine, entry RVA, OriginalFilename), `d12-dotnet-*`, `d13-msi-*`,\n  `d14-lnk-*`, `d15-ooxml-*`, `d16-email-*`, `d17-audio-*`, `d18-video-*`, `d19-elf-*`, `d20-macho-*`, `d21-apk-*`,\n  `d22-jar-*` + synthesis. Dispatch on the answer-id S